<title>PORTUGAL: Goldman Sachs issues 10 bln esc navigator bond.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs issues 10 bln esc navigator bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs Group is issuing a 10 billion escudo 10-year Navigator bond, joint lead managers Banco Finantia and Banco Cisf said in a statement.</p>
<p>The issue is indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 20 basis points.</p>
<p>Payment date is set for April 24 and the issue matures in 2007.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
